Package: shared-lib
Version: 1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Test Fixture <test@example.com>
Description: fixture package representing a transitive dependency shared
 by both a module's and the base-module's resolved closure — its payload
 must be excluded from the owned set (present on both sides of the
 subtraction) but WOULD be swept up by an overly-broad file_spec glob,
 which is what the deb-bad-module fixture's RED conformance case exercises.
